title: 밤_1_조깅하기_서은표_영문
---
(I sat on a bench to take a quick break while jogging.)
(While catching my breath on the bench, I see a familiar face across the way.)
EunPyo: Oh~?!  
<<play 공통_조깅>>
(EunPyo, who also seems to be jogging, runs toward me.)
<<show pyo_smile_ver2>>
<<play pyo_sound>>
EunPyo: Is that you, {name()}?
(EunPyo waves her hand to say hi.)
{name()}: Hey. Are you out for a jog?
<<show pyo_idle_ver2>>
EunPyo: Yeah. Are you too, {name()}?
{name()}: Yeah. The weather is nice, so I thought I'd get some exercise.
(Beads of sweat are forming on EunPyo's forehead.)
<<choice 주1_월_밤_조깅하기_서은표_긍1_영문 "Want some water?" 주1_월_밤_조깅하기_서은표_부1_영문 "(Don't ask)">>
(Should I offer her some water? I've already had some of it, though...)
===

title: 주1_월_밤_조깅하기_서은표_긍1_영문
---
{name()}: Want some water?
{name()}: I've already drank some, but...
(I held up the water bottle to show her.)
<<like 서은표>>
<<change lvPyo +10>>
<<show pyo_shock_ver2>>
<<play 서은표_웃음>>
EunPyo: Really?!  
<<show pyo_smile_ver2>>
EunPyo: Then I'd love some!
{name()}: Here.
(I handed her the water bottle.)
(EunPyo took a drink of the water.)
<<show pyo_idle_ver2>>
EunPyo: Thanks. I feel alive again. I forgot to bring my own bottle today.
<<jump 주1_월_밤_조깅하기_서은표_분기1_영문>>
===

title: 주1_월_밤_조깅하기_서은표_부1_영문
---
(Since I've already drank from it, it might be a bit awkward.)
(I didn't ask.)
<<jump 주1_월_밤_조깅하기_서은표_분기1_영문>>
===

title: 주1_월_밤_조깅하기_서은표_분기1_영문
---
<<show pyo_idle_ver2>>
EunPyo: Do you mind if I sit here for a second?
{name()}: Not at all.
EunPyo: Do you jog often?
EunPyo: I come out every day.
{name()}: Every day?? That’s impressive.
<<show pyo_neg_ver2>>
<<play 서은표_흠>>
EunPyo: I don't have much of a choice. Since I'm in the soccer club...
(EunPyo gave a shy smile.)
EunPyo: It's part of my training.
{name()}: The soccer club? That sounds cool.
(We chatted about the soccer club for a while.)
<<show pyo_smile_ver2>>
(EunPyo says she's a goalkeeper. She looks shy, but she gives off the vibe of a pro.)
<<if get("lvPyo") >= 10>>
    <<show pyo_blush_ver2>>
    EunPyo: If we have a match next time, do you want to come watch?
    EunPyo: Our team is pretty good, so it should be fun to watch...
<<endif>>
<<show pyo_neg2_ver2>>
EunPyo: Ah, I didn't realize it had gotten so late already.
EunPyo: I should get back to my run.
<<show pyo_smile_ver2>>
EunPyo: See you at school, {name()}!
{name()}: Yeah, have a safe workout.
<<play 공통_조깅>>
(EunPyo jogged away and disappeared into the distance.)
<<end>>
===